Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Could this have happened\Nwhile we were sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.46,0:00:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,To me and Giorno?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.90,0:00:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista and Trish?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.44,0:00:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of messed up\Nvoodoo crap is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.96,0:00:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Last I checked, people's minds\Ncouldn't just trade bodies?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.30,0:00:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay your hands for now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.72,0:00:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, that can't be a stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.88,0:00:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Zipperman?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.38,0:00:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't no doubt!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.92,0:00:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.84,0:00:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,In my eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.76,0:00:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to turn back on my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.32,0:00:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.23,0:00:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.10,0:00:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn back on my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.80,0:01:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.94,0:02:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go to the world,\Nand I'm going to go to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.64,0:02:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to die,\Nbut I'm not going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.78,0:02:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,When I'm in my body, I'm going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.56,0:02:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, the beginning of the golden wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.04,0:02:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank God!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.74,0:02:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad to have you back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.08,0:02:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You even beat the boss to the\Npunch and tracked down the arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.28,0:02:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that cadence.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.16,0:02:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how Narancia\Nspeaks, if memory serves.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.18,0:02:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.00,0:02:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.20,0:02:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought so. And you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.30,0:02:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Giorno.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.28,0:02:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm Trish.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.74,0:02:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Impressive work, Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.94,0:02:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears you've already\Npieced together what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.58,0:02:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.90,0:02:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you the man we were\Nsupposed to meet with?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.14,0:03:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Jean-Pierre Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.52,0:03:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I died by Diavolo's hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.84,0:03:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,However, after switching\Nsouls with this turtle,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.70,0:03:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I was able to maintain a presence here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.04,0:03:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,like a ghost might haunt\Nthe plane of the living.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.60,0:03:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And that over there is my stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.24,0:03:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,With the arrow's power, he was\Ntransformed into Chariot Requiem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.48,0:03:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He is responsible for our displaced souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.26,0:03:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.17,0:03:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,if my soul's in this body, then it's only\Nnatural to conclude the boss is inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.78,0:03:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, don't worry about\Nhim, he hasn't moved at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.62,0:03:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Guy's sleeping like a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.60,0:03:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Might you be, Mista?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.22,0:03:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm really glad to\Nsee you're okay, old buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.38,0:03:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, number seven's\Ngot his eye on your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.80,0:03:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's so much as twitches,\Nwe'll know immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.90,0:03:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Again, he's out cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.48,0:03:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Might be a while before he gets up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.68,0:03:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.59,0:03:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Chariot Requiem's back on his feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.02,0:04:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We've already learned\Nhow to use the arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.34,0:04:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can just grab it,\Nthis'll all be over!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.68,0:04:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this, Zipperman?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.58,0:04:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.22,0:04:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, the arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.08,0:04:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Requiem's going for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.52,0:04:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Not on my watch, you little bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.92,0:04:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait, something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.42,0:04:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Miseria, did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.96,0:04:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill you, you stupid ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.08,0:04:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That thick skull of yours is about to\Nbecome holier than a dog-shitting priest!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.96,0:04:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The pillar next to you! Mesa! Doc!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.38,0:04:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Spicy lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.38,0:05:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Die, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.28,0:05:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna blast your\Nugly head open and paint
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.56,0:05:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,the streets with your\Nchunky noodle juices!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.20,0:05:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never want to cut the shit out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.58,0:05:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you think\Nyou're doing, you moron?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.86,0:05:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.30,0:05:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.46,0:05:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What was I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.10,0:05:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.22,0:05:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.14,0:05:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.14,0:05:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Requiem, he's going for the arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.30,0:05:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't just let him take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.76,0:05:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you gotta be freaking kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.08,0:05:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How did all that just happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.60,0:05:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were to guess, it's a\Nresult of his frenetic state.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.78,0:05:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even I have seen Chariot show\Nsuch terrifying powers before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.56,0:05:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But this much is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.38,0:05:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,In response to my subconscious\Nwill, he's become a defensive stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.96,0:06:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as he lives, he'll\Nallow no one to touch the arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.66,0:06:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,To turn stands against their users.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.12,0:06:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a cunning defense mechanism\Nwill prove challenging to defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.66,0:06:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So not only can the arrow control all\Nour minds, it can pull tricks like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.48,0:06:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to get at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.36,0:06:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude is out of control!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.78,0:06:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, our stands might\Nbe supercharged, but that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.00,0:06:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,just means if we try to\Ngrab the arrow right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.68,0:06:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll get roasted alive
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.82,0:06:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Holly, you pipe down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.14,0:06:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.92,0:06:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Smirbles!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.86,0:06:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever's inside, Bucciarati,\Nthey're coming too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.28,0:06:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,My god, is it him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.34,0:06:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We can worry about the arrow later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.16,0:07:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Get into place and don't\Ntake your eyes off him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.84,0:07:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Mista, take a shot and make it count!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.72,0:07:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.96,0:07:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Put those bullets of yours to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.70,0:07:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I heard, but dude, did you forget\Nthat's your body I'd be shooting at?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.40,0:07:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.20,0:07:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden Wind can patch up\Nbullet wounds without effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.52,0:07:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So shoot, all we gotta\Ndo is incapacitate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.68,0:07:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That was your plan, right, Bucciarati?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.84,0:07:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, he's on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.38,0:07:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.58,0:07:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That should do it, fellas!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.06,0:07:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think he'll be\Ncharging at us anytime soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.78,0:07:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's showing up on my radar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.02,0:07:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like there won't be\Nany backup to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.80,0:07:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.12,0:08:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we get the arrow,\Nthis'll all be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.12,0:08:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, when we're back in\NNapoli, it's off to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.12,0:08:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hot damn, I'm already psyched.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.86,0:08:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The first thing I'll do is stuff my\Nface with an authentic margarita slice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.92,0:08:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Might even top it with porcini's.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.82,0:08:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,After that...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.18,0:08:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If I ever see Fugo again, he can\Ncall me a kagakatsu all he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.24,0:08:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't give two shits.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.34,0:08:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And even though Bakio's gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.30,0:08:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Trish!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.38,0:08:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll protect you till my dying breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.06,0:08:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.64,0:08:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.55,0:08:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, just to be safe,\Ntake out both of his legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.16,0:08:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.88,0:08:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Trish, would you mind\Nhanding me my bullets?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.50,0:08:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I want them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.46,0:08:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Just reach down into\Nmy boot and grab them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.22,0:08:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.42,0:09:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, pick up the pace, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.28,0:09:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Those legs won't shoot themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.94,0:09:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.02,0:09:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Time jumped. Just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.70,0:09:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We skipped a few seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.16,0:09:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.07,0:09:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The bullets that fell on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.38,0:09:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Did anyone actually hear them land?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.36,0:09:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.27,0:09:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I was watching him closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.74,0:09:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Not once did I catch him move,\Nlet alone evoke Emperor Crimson.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.40,0:09:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It just doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.56,0:09:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What other nefarious forces could\Npossibly be haunting us this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.50,0:09:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Trish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.86,0:09:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I might need a little favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.02,0:09:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you go ahead and drop\None more bullet for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.90,0:09:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on! Are you deaf?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.62,0:09:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you even count how many of them\Nare rolling around there right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.94,0:09:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The answer's four!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.20,0:09:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The absolute freaking worst!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.48,0:09:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't have that bullshit\Nnumber anywhere near me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.34,0:09:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If they fell while you\Nwere handing them over,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.38,0:10:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,then for the love of God, do me\Na solid and drop another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.62,0:10:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How sure are we exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.10,0:10:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Diavolo in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.70,0:10:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Trish.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.84,0:10:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you just remind me again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.18,0:10:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,When we all woke up,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.66,0:10:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,you said you couldn't sense the\Nboss anywhere, isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.76,0:10:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what about now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.68,0:10:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you picking up anything at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.56,0:10:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That cannot be the case!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.46,0:10:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You swapped with Narancia, and\Naccordingly Mista swapped with Trish.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.38,0:10:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It stands to reason Buterati\Nswapped with Diavolo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.56,0:10:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,With Requiem's powers, they're\Nthe only pairings that work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.34,0:10:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I get what you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.62,0:10:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But none of that explains\Nwhy time just jumped.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.18,0:10:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That can only mean whoever's in that\Nbody right now can't possibly be Diavolo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.26,0:10:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia, how does our perimeter look?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.64,0:10:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you able to detect anyone coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.16,0:10:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.12,0:11:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.00,0:11:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one more bullet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.56,0:11:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, just drop one more!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.84,0:11:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You're driving me back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.75,0:11:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.67,0:11:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why couldn't I feel a\Nsoul like I usually do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.16,0:11:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't make any sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.40,0:11:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of the way! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.12,0:11:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me through! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.50,0:11:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.46,0:11:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.64,0:11:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How on earth could he have?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.04,0:11:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Misha, scan the area right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.04,0:11:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure there's no one around!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.26,0:11:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia! Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.18,0:11:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.09,0:11:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and get him down from there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.78,0:11:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just leave him like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.26,0:11:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Do something, goddammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.30,0:11:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to settle down!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.48,0:11:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me handle this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.56,0:11:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stay focused and\Nkeep your gun at the ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.84,0:11:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll attack again!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.02,0:11:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to find him before he does, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.24,0:11:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Go! Zipperman!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.72,0:12:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Heal him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.80,0:12:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull those jam bars out of\Nthere and get to work now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.14,0:12:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The people outside the\NColosseum are waking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.18,0:12:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.48,0:12:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't sense him at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.02,0:12:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.84,0:12:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What else could have happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.60,0:12:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way in hell he'd\Njust up and vanish like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.50,0:12:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Emperor Crimson's range is\Ntwo or three meters at most.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.96,0:12:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,How then did he attack\Nus from way over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.72,0:12:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, alright! You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.74,0:12:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Naraj is awake!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.52,0:12:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, you little bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.90,0:12:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.74,0:12:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez, you really scared us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.30,0:12:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Mista.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.02,0:12:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,There's...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.93,0:12:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,no one left...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.66,0:12:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.94,0:12:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.76,0:12:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The physical wounds he\Nsuffered have healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.38,0:13:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But still, Golden Wind\Ncouldn't get to him in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.76,0:13:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He was...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.02,0:13:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,he was already gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.00,0:13:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm just not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.62,0:13:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,His form, it's just an empty vessel now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.30,0:13:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.60,0:13:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,His soul has left.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.88,0:13:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.18,0:13:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Try as I might, I can't bring him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.44,0:13:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't fast enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.30,0:13:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My soul could just slip\Nright back in if it wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.92,0:13:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It could inhabit both bodies\Nwithout a problem, not even one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.22,0:13:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He's that empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.60,0:13:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.68,0:13:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It was all so sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.78,0:13:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,None of us could have guessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.40,0:14:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.70,0:15:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.28,0:15:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Where could he be hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.86,0:15:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This should never have happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.66,0:15:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The only explanation is if\Nthere were two Diavolos!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.38,0:15:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.29,0:15:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The child that appeared before him…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.34,0:15:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.30,0:15:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Were both of them…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.88,0:15:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,One physical body with\Ntwo different souls?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.10,0:15:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Butcherati!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.08,0:15:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.99,0:15:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Diavolo must have two personalities.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.58,0:15:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the only possible answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.68,0:15:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The one currently inside your body\Nis the young man I met earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.84,0:15:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He and Diavolo may share a physical\Nbody, but their souls are separate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.36,0:15:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The human soul can be a\Nstrange and delicate thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.74,0:15:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,A traumatic childhood event\Ncan easily fissure it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.28,0:15:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,As the individual grows, so too do\Nthe fissures until the soul is split.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.88,0:16:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Over time, the second personality\Ndistinguishes itself from the original,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.58,0:16:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,with one of them soon becoming dominant.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.96,0:16:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a well-documented disorder.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.58,0:16:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.82,0:16:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What I'm saying is no mere conjecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.22,0:16:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Reports from across Europe\Nconfirm that even one's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.12,0:16:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,physical form will change as\Nthe personalities alternate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.76,0:16:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Requiem managed to extract these two\Nsouls from the singular body they share.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.94,0:16:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,One of them, the young man's, found\Nits way into Bucciarati's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.30,0:16:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The other one, however,\Nfor reasons unknown,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.20,0:16:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,has established itself in\Na body we haven't found.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.90,0:16:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how Diavolo took us by surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.04,0:16:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't think he'd still be\Nroaming around in a different vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.40,0:16:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This shit hurts my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.00,0:16:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Two personalities?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.28,0:16:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's what the boss has been hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.86,0:16:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,As we speak, countless\Ncivilians are awakening.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.06,0:16:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The haystack will soon\Ngrow intractably large.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.76,0:17:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm certain he'll pounce on us again,\Nand this time he'll finish the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.14,0:17:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's one scenario.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.82,0:17:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,However, it's just as likely\Nhe's nowhere near us right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.18,0:17:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Diavolo wants the arrow too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.34,0:17:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is why Narancia was\Nthe first one targeted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.48,0:17:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He's blinded us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.56,0:17:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We've lost our only radar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.52,0:17:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's enabling him to move about freely.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.38,0:17:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can track him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.56,0:17:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Not with Lil Balmer, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.50,0:17:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but even so, you must\Nkeep your focus on the Arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.68,0:17:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no point in going after\NEmperor Crimson without its power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.52,0:17:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's precisely why we need to\Nlocate Requiem before he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.52,0:17:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember which way he went?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.64,0:17:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,To the West.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.72,0:17:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He's left a trail of people\Nregaining consciousness in his wake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.04,0:17:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.95,0:17:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really planning to\Nchase him down right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.26,0:17:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What about your mangled body back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.54,0:17:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I avoided his vital organs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.52,0:17:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll live, but he's not\Ngetting up anytime soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.42,0:17:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I made sure of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.52,0:18:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay put, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.60,0:18:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be safe here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.90,0:18:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let anyone hurt you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.00,0:18:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.28,0:18:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't you worry, when it's\Nover we'll bring you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.94,0:18:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out for anybody\Ncoming near us. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.50,0:18:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Trish what are you doing stay close right
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.56,0:19:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.70,0:19:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're under arrest!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.96,0:19:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here and let me show you\Nhow these cuffs look on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.32,0:19:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.23,0:19:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everything alright back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.74,0:19:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.65,0:19:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a false alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.20,0:19:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy rushed at me so\NI thought he was the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.72,0:19:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But it was just a dumbass cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.70,0:19:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's become increasingly clear to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.62,0:19:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Requiem has neither directional\Nnor emotional objectives.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.50,0:19:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Though we've closed in on him, he\Nhasn't once turned to look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.42,0:19:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no question\Nhe's a living organism.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.28,0:20:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if the resemblance he bears to some\Nrubber figurine would suggest otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.06,0:20:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,In his mind I've yet to\Neven register as a threat,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.46,0:20:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,but even if I did he can\Nbarely throw a punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.48,0:20:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Still his physical presence is quite real.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.18,0:20:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean he's been seen\Nand touched hasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.86,0:20:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,it's no good can't even get close it's not\Njust our stands anything we throw at it
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.70,0:20:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,it sends flying right back in our faces\Nthis arrow might really be untouchable it
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.70,0:20:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,doesn't matter how hard you try to reach\Nfor it it's gonna push you back with just
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.58,0:21:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,as much force and here he comes again How
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.16,0:21:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,are we supposed to pick\Nthis damn thing up?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.40,0:21:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like it's mocking us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.86,0:21:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Requiem won't allow stand\Nusers to pick up the arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.40,0:21:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Which leads me to think,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.08,0:21:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,what if a person without the gift\Nwere to go ahead and try their luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.54,0:21:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Would they succeed?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.82,0:21:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what are your thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.40,0:21:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I look like, a stand scientist?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.68,0:21:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell should I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.08,0:21:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.40,0:21:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.60,0:21:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been reduced to a reptile\Nfighting to hold on to its dear soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.72,0:21:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That means I'm no longer a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.34,0:21:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't repel me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.60,0:21:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.51,0:21:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.60,0:21:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Take the arrow and infill your stand now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.70,0:22:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We are the power who'll\Nsee the future cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.86,0:22:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We are the fighters just\Nfighting for a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.70,0:23:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
